[options]
[A.]
                       <h2>Assassination of the Furies <a href="#mission23">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                               ~[Igeyser.17]
<br>
After you killed the King of Nimbus, the {sw_god5} appears to have become very confident in your faith.
 He has decided to grant you the ability of Transformation.<br>
This ability will let you serve by ~rHades~. side up in the Duesphere. His plans are
for you and him to battle the Furies, and forever put an end to them!
<p>
                              Will you accept this ability?
$Button=YES,Tell,Deal
$Button=NO,Tell,NoDeal

[Deal]
You have been granted the special ability of Transformation!<br>
Congratulations! May you use it well.
$Button=kewl,Tell,A1

[NoDeal]
<h2>You have chosen not to accept this ability. Are you nuts?</h2>
<p>
Do you know what missions lie ahead of you?
 Without this ability, you will surely perish, for no known mortal priest has ever passed into the Duesphere without this ability.
 How do you think the Furies survive here?
<p>
So, you have no other choice but to accept it.</h2>
<p>
The {sw_god5} has given you the ability of Transformation.
$Button=OK,Tell,A1



[A1]
                     <h2>Assassination of the Furies <a href="#mission23">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                             ~[Igeyser.17]
<br>
You have been teleported to the DuesPhere...
<p>
The Furies have agreed to battle you and your master in a final battle, but under certain conditions.
<p>
For this final Confrontation, each Fury and yourself have agreed upon only allowing
 a single major weapon and a single minor weapon of choice from your arsenal.
<p>
First, chooses the {sw_god1}. The rain Fury ponders long and hard. Then he decides:
<br>
<i>I will command the sunArcher and the BULF.</i><br>
                                  ~[IsunArcher.33]                   ~[Ibulf.74]
<br>
<$PlaySound,forRain2.wav>
$Button=Wow! What a break!,Tell,A2

[A2]
              <h2>Assassination of the Furies <a href="#mission23">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                      ~[Igeyser.17]
<br>
Next, chooses the {sw_god2}. The wind Fury wastes no time. He declares for all to
 hear:<br>
<i>I will command the sunArcher and the BULF.</i><br>
                                  ~[IsunArcher.33]                   ~[Ibulf.74]
<br>
Hmmm... what strange choices. They're not even picking their alignments!
<$PlaySound,forWind2.wav>
$Button=More,Tell,A3

[A3]
                   <h2>Assassination of the Furies <a href="#mission23">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                           ~[Igeyser.17]
<br>
Now comes the {sw_god3}. He lumbers by you like you weren't even there. He bellows
 into the night:<br>
<i>I will command the sunArcher and the BULF.</i><br>
                                  ~[IsunArcher.33]                   ~[Ibulf.74]
<br>
Can it be? Why are they selecting so? Do they not fear me?, you think to yourself
<$PlaySound,forThunder2.wav>
$Button=More,Tell,A4

[A4]
                                         <h2>Assassination of the Furies <a href="#mission23">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                                                 ~[Igeyser.17]
<br>
Finally, the {sw_god5} makes his choice. When he speaks, you muscles clench and your
 teeth clamp together. A shiver runs up your spine, as his words echo into the still
 air....<br>
<i>I will command the sunArcher and the BULF.</i><br>
                                  ~[IsunArcher.33]                   ~[Ibulf.74]
<br>
What is going on here, you think to yourself. Is my master out of his mind?
 Why didn't he pick good weapons to battle the other Furies with?
<$PlaySound,forStorm.wav>
$Button=More,Tell,A5     

[A5]
                     <h2>Assassination of the Furies <a href="#mission23">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
                             ~[Igeyser.17]
<br>
At last, it's your turn. Click one item from below. This is your MAJOR Weapon. You
 will have one more choice of a DEFENSIVE WEAPON after you choose here:
<p>
~3              ~[Iflag.3]ATTACK WEAPON~[Iflag.3]~.<br>
     <a href="cmd:GetTechNology,71">~[IsunArcher.33]</a>
     <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,128>~[IsunCannon.2]</a>
     <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,72">~[IsunAviary.0]</a>
     <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,129">~[IrainCannon.3]</a>
     <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,140">~[IwindArcher.60]</a>
<br>
           <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,139">~[IwindAviary.1]</a>
     <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,148">~[IthunderArcher.1]</a>
     <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,131">~[IthunderCannon.35]</a>
     <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,143">~[IrainAviary.7]</a>
<br>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,priestMove3.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A5

[@1]
<$Tell,A6>

[A6]
                     <h2>Assassination of the Furies <a href="#mission23">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
<br>
Now. You're last choice. Pick wisely from the list below!
<br>
     ~3            ~[Iflag.3]DEFENSIVE WEAPON~[Iflag.3]~.<br>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,135">~[IBulf.76]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,136">~[IsunFence.4]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,78">~[IsunBlocker.*]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,137">~[IwindWalker.4]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,146">~[IrainBalloon.*]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,156">~[IrainWalker.19]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,145">~[IrainFence.3]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,141">~[IwindBalloon.0]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,111">~[Isunballoon.0]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,147">~[IrainBlocker.0]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,142">~[IwindBlocker.2]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,149">~[IthunderFence.3]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,126">~[Ioutpost.0]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,79">~[IthunderBlocker.0]</a>
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,priestMove1.wav
$Button= ,Tell,A6

[@10]
You call to your Master:<br>
~IMaster, let us attack the rain Fury together, and start to take care of our
 enemies together!
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0
[@15]
There is no response from ~rHADES
$Button=?,DoNothing,0

[@20]
<$MoveDialog,tl>
What is going on here? Why is your Master not allied with you?
$Button=?,DoNothing,0

[@25]
You call to {sw_hades}:
<br>
~iMaster, what's is going on? Why are you not allied to me?
$Button=??,DoNothing,0

[@30]
<$MoveDialog,tr>
                              <h2>{sw_hades}<h2> speaks to you:</h2><br>
<i>"Groveler, you have ventured far to experience your own death! The Furies
 have agreed to make me the Master of all if I help to destroy you. So I don't
 need you anymore. With four Furies against one wimpy warrior, I'm sure to prevail!"
<p>
"Don't take it personally, you poor wretched fool! It's just that I was given
 an offer that I couldn't refuse! So, with that, your Apprenticeship has officially
 ended"
<p>
"Oh, don't worry.... when I sacrifice you, your soul will go down to<br>
 {sw_hades}<i> for me to forever torture and torment!"
$Button=This is BAD!,DoNothing,0

[@35]
<$MoveDialog,tl>
                  <h2>You call out to {sw_hades}:</h2><br>
~I"But, Master. What about all I've done for you. How about all the Nimbian souls
 I have brought you? I've done everything you've asked."
 <p>
 "I thought we had a deal? If I did your bidding and helped you become supreme Ruler
 of Nimbus, you said you'd set me free!"
$OnExit= ,PlaySound,treasonCast.wav
$Button=Say it isn't so?,DoNothing,0

[@40]
<$MoveDialog,tr>
        <h2>{sw_hades} bellows to you:</h2><br>
          ~4<i>~rSILENCE~.<br>
 <i>, you pathethic excuse for a Nimbian!
<p>
                 Groveler, prepare to <br>
                           ~4DIE!~.
$Button=bad news!,DoNothing,0

[@120]
<$MoveDialog,tl>
To your horror, you also notice that the 4 Furies did not keep their word. They
 are using any and every weapon available to them!
<p>
~I"So much for honor, I guess"~., you think to yourself. Oh well, you're a warrior
 of your word. You will not break your vow to only use 1 attack weapon and 1 defensive
 weapon....
$Button=What else can go against me?,DoNothing,0


[ai2PriestCaptured][ai3PriestCaptured][ai4PriestCaptured][ai5PriestCaptured]
<$PlaySound,forStorm2.wav>
You have captured one of the Furies! Excellent job!
$Button=OK,DoNothing,0


[ai2PriestDead]
<$Config,sw_enDead2=1>
The {sw_god2} has been sacrificed. Way to go! You are almost Free from this
 tyrrany!
$Button=Fight on!,Tell,weapselect2

[weapselect2]
<$Config,sw_weapon2=1>
You've defeated the {sw_god2}!<br>
You may select 1 of the items below by clicking on the picture... However, that would break your word,
since prior to this battle, you vowed to use only the weapons you initially chose.
<br>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,140">~[IwindArcher.60]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,139">~[IwindAviary.1]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,141">~[IwindBalloon.0]</a>
   <a href="cmd:GetTechnology,142">~[IwindBlocker.2]</a>
<p>
Are you a Nimbian of your word, and dare to face the rest of the Furies with your limited
abilities, or do you recant your word, and show your followers that your words are like the
empty promises that have been spoken by so many others before you?
$OnExit= ,Tell,checkwin
$Button=I wil not cower before the might of the FURIES!,tell,nocower2

