[checkwin]
<?{sw_enDead2}><?{sw_enDead3}>
<?{sw_enDead4}><?{sw_enDead5}>
                                                     <h2>VICTORY IS YOURS! </h2>
                        
                           ~[Ipriest.89]   ~[IsunFlyerBomb.14]<br>
As you make the last sacrifice, you hear a loud tearing, as if
the very fabric of space is being shredded!
<p>
You see before you an opening: first small, then growing very quickly!
 Its a bright blue white opening that first surrounds the four Furies souls,
 and their islands, then engulfs them in flames!
<p>
You watch as the once almighty Furies of ~[ImanaBolt.0]~oWIND~[ImanaBolt.0]~.,
 ~[ImanaBolt.1]~lRAIN~[ImanaBolt.1]~., ~[ImanaBolt.2]~mTHUNDER~[ImanaBolt.2]~.,
  and ~[IbombExplodeLarge.1]~kDEATH~[IbombExplodeLarge.1]~. melt into the ground one by one in front of you!
<p>
                                                     {sw_hades} yells out to you:
<br><i>
          "What have you done? You have trapped us all into the BOWELS of ~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]~r~BHELL~.~[IsunFlyerBomb.2]<i>"
<br>
                         <i>"NOOOOO! We must be free to torment other souls at will!"
<$Config,sw_m30=1>
<$Config,sw_m11=0>
$Button=Congrats! ONTO the celebration!,MissionBegin,sw_m30
</?></?></?></?>


[Failed]
The Furies are amused at your futile attempts. They would like you to try again,
 so they can amuse themselves with your sacrifice again.
<p>
So, {sw_hades}, with his mighty magic, resurrects you from the grave, and you are
 allowed to battle yet once again!
$Button=To battle,MissionBegin,sw_m23

[END]
